# 8. Recommended Future Architecture

The current system can evolve without introducing unnecessary agent-framework complexity.

The intended architecture can become:

```text
                    VIDEO
                      ↓
              Video Processing
                      ↓
            Content Profile Builder
                      ↓
             ┌─────────────────┐
             │ Audience        │
             │ Simulator       │
             └─────────────────┘
                ↓     ↓     ↓
             Persona Reactions
                      ↓
              Engagement Metrics
                      ↓
             Distribution Rounds
                      ↓
             Virality Prediction
                      ↓
             Why Will It Win/Fall?
                      ↓
               Creator Insights
```

The final system should not only answer:

> "How viral is this video?"

It should also answer:

> "Why is it likely to perform this way?"

