The longer-term goal should therefore be:

```text
Video
 ↓
Analyze
 ↓
Simulate Audience
 ↓
Predict Engagement
 ↓
Identify Bottleneck
 ↓
Generate Improvement
 ↓
Predict Potential Impact
```

For example:

```text
Problem:
Weak Hook

Recommendation:
Move payoff to first 2 seconds

Expected Effect:
Higher watch rate
        ↓
Higher retention
        ↓
Higher completion
        ↓
Higher distribution score
```

This creates a feedback loop where the system can potentially help creators improve the content rather than merely evaluate it.

